# XenonX Core — scaffold v0.1

Android/Kotlin-oriented emulator core scaffolding for the XenonX project.

## Included
- CoreEngine lifecycle and subsystem initialization/cleanup
- CoreState lifecycle states
- GameLoader file metadata inspection (does not parse or execute game images)
- Input button event dispatch
- CPU, memory, graphics, and audio interfaces

## Not implemented
This is not a working Xbox emulator. It contains no Xbox CPU instruction interpreter, chipset/memory map, GPU emulation, audio hardware emulation, firmware, or game execution.

## Integration
Copy `src/main/kotlin/com/xenonx/core` into the Android app's Kotlin source tree. Adjust the package path if the existing app uses a different namespace.
